Package: rk3588-camera-overlays
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, u-boot-menu | u-boot-tools
Description: Device-tree overlays for RK3588 IMX708 cameras
 Prebuilt .dtbo overlays for Orange Pi 5/5B and ROCK 5B+ camera
 connectors. Installs under /usr/share/rk3588-camera/overlays and
 provides /etc/rk3588-camera/overlays.conf for u-boot-menu selection.
